    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adf54bcf51041ec429cc2e9b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大家都期待她“达成经典三冠”或\n“超越鲁道夫象征”，\n鲁道夫象征本人也对她抱持着高度的关注。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6574419a99fee1c3f142dda47e116159373cdd22763666b077733cc21337e1eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
