    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:646b08b59c30b9b3bd93d243",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁的弱点在于竞争心太强，\n每当受到挑战时必会有所回应，\n不只打乱步调还会消耗持久力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67c9be8013faa568cbddef1626efc6217e5c1dd68d3e3d7cbeaf3ccbd102b05e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1016/storytimeline_501016401.json",
      "json_path": [
