      "uid": "zhcn:4e768d28bbacf69b93aa7973",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员建议她改采新的跑法。\n要她即使受到挑战也不要回应并忍耐至极限，\n在最后一刻才让累积的竞争心爆发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "651d73e81d107adba86966836ca3d0c46d5df0ca519a46b3a45b246eea8d0a76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
