      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁以新的跑法在模拟赛胜出。\n赛后的她仍旧热血沸腾，\n连感到疲惫的时间都没有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e1af24518bb1f9e3d3226b1825002224dc5a10321b98bb76af232cf9ff0d693",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
