      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，成田白仁向鲁道夫象征宣战。\n这令人震撼的传闻，\n传遍了整个学园──",
      "source_fingerprint": "977bbd01dac50dda22d6d2530cbb23cf5eb3ba2709a36af80cf437660f25c2ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
